    "summary": "FFmpeg 3.0 through versions before 9.0 failed to validate that an RSCC tile decompressed to its declared size. The decoder could copy the unwritten suffix of a persistent heap buffer into the output frame, disclosing data from prior allocations or previously decoded frames.",
